    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli aba giijeeda Sinayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geeng'usha sheedeaba samwagu bea damanda rina fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri, eaweedida ghwahita dareapcheeda Sinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa abeeda ghang'eada Refidimu ama siihiiidu dareapcheeda Sinayi geewus aba jeeda dareapcheeda, ak gawus fuga Israeli aba madeeda giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadiyeada Musa gawa uhuuda giijeeda heeda ASEETA, ak gaguursa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa aba uhuuda giijeeda nea gwayeesha, “Rukusiina fuga gheeh Yakobo, nea giyeeshi eara fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noadaayi gideasimi fuga Misri ea gida aasareandaneegwa gawuurji gidasareeniida rabearda diibigaaschi aba meang'eega, ak geayeaneegwa heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa inyas gooleeysean iit ak ghoamwaschi ng'asheegeasu, nea ghoang'waanyi neajeedeanyu, abeeda gajawoosa fugeasu miyaasiin aba bugusta buuneesean aba gideaba ng'eanyiisean deanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajahuuwa aba heedeanyu sugoocheanduumeeda ashoohoodiga, ea eemeeda ghaydit. Suh ng'asheega jea rukusiina diibiga Israeli gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Musa ak gaguursa gweargwa Israeli, ak gwarukusa aba madeeda nyaawa ng'asheega sean rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha buuneesean nea gwayeesha, “Gajeesina ng'asheega sean rugu NG'UTAMIIDA.” Hean ghwaat Musa iita ng'asheega buuneeda heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Gaydahidu headaang'u nea geandi jeeda shamooghooda, ak gwayiing'shi buuneeda damanda eabaloolaneeyi, ak ghamwasnyi damanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukwiisa Musa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, “Una heeda buuneeda ak ginung' ghoamiidu geat ghamneawa ea numuji, nea goohuun eara hang'weaka nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghaghamwat geat eaweedeaba samwagu aba gideaba eaweedeaba samwagu gayghwararang'aana NG'UTAMIIDA uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi, ea ghwahidu madeeda buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisisi moonghooda buuneeda nea giyeeshi, ‘Adiidu gooding'di uhuuda giijeeda nea adiidu ghoasachi eara moonghoadaanyi, ak siida wassean sat giijeeda gajeanung' ghami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea manda siida jea ghwasat niny, aba gideaba gajeefta lagheanga, ghana eang'uda ng'uta, gilinyoo ea diyeayda gil ghanea siida gil iisat giijeeda gayghami.’ Inyas ghwayiiy buuneeda ghuuta durumbeati abeeda dadiyeana buuneeda ghapka uhuuda giijeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwararang'aana Musa uhuuda giijeeda ak gawa heeda buuneeda, ak ghwanung' ghoamiidu geat buuneeda, nea goohuun hang'weaka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Aghamwada geat eaweedeaba samwagu, nea aduwi heeda gatmooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sakteayda bea eaweeteaba samwagu ghwahidu giighweandandeeda ea dadamandeeda, ea dung'usta haw aba uhuuda giijeeda, ea nyeashta haw bea durumbeati ea ghabeal buuneesean mida jeeda maheemajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooruuna Musa buuneeda jeeda maheemajeanda ak ghwaat gwaroonyi ASEETA, ak ghamiinaada aba geeshta giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarina giijeeda sean bea Sinayi aroosta, aba gideaba ghwararang'aana NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda beasta, ak gwadiyeada aroostida nea gawuurji aroosta beasta duwayda geeyi bwak ea ghaboadan giijeesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niraanya nyeashta durumbeati goobalool Musa ASEETA, ak ghwasha ASEETA aba jeeda gighweendandeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwararang'aana NG'UTAMIIDA uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi, was uhuuda giijeeda heeda geaw, ak gaguursa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa gawa uhuuda giijeeda heeda geaw, ak gawa Musa gwadiyeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Una rarang'aada ak gireekusi buuneeda, gideaba adiidu gwasin naweeda ak ghapka heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak goosha gea saang'a aba jeenyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ashoohoodiga damiina geat damanda mii ghapkaana heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba adiidu geanyareeksi saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Buuneeda mayghapka uhuuda giijeeda Sinayi, aba gideaba ghayi giyeeshiineasa, ‘Asina moonghooda aba murdeeda giijeeda ak ghoakghaydiichi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA niny, “Una rarang'aada ak gischeeng'u nea giideani Haruni nea ashoohoodiga ea buuneeda ea adagwascheeng'u ghapka heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba adiidu geanyareeksi saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwararang'aada Musa gawa heeda buuneeda ak gwarukusa saawa ng'asheegiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
